{"event": "sub_agent_completed", "source": "EnhancedExerciseGenerationAgent", "target": "MainAgent", "request_id": "dbe2bf23-b633-4764-8941-ae812a45d847", "user_id": "1234", "timestamp": "2026-05-08T16:58:22", "payload": {"success": true, "response": "已生成练习题:\n\n标题: 统计元音字母个数\n主题: python_basics | 难度: beginner\n描述: 编写一个名为 count_vowels 的函数，接受一个字符串参数 s，统计并返回字符串中元音字母（a, e, i, o, u）的个数。大小写字母应视为相同，例如 'A' 和 'a' 都算作元音。\n\n要求:\n- 完成题目要求\n\n示例:\n- 输入: count_vowels('Hello')\n  输出: 2\n- 输入: count_vowels('PYTHON')\n  输出: 1\n\n分级提示:\n1. 轻提示：遍历字符串中的每个字符，判断它是否是元音字母。\n2. 中提示：可以先使用 s.lower() 将字符串转为小写，然后检查字符是否在字符串 'aeiou' 中。\n3. 强提示：如果字符在 'aeiou' 中，就把计数器加 1，遍历结束后返回计数器。\n\n下一步: 完成后尝试改写成更通用的函数，并挑战进阶变式题。\n来源: question_bank", "details": {"type": "exercise", "topic": "python_basics", "difficulty": "beginner", "personalized": true, "source": "question_bank", "question_count": 1, "exercise": {"id": 6, "topic": "python_basics", "content": "<dict>", "difficulty": "beginner", "question_type": "coding", "answer": "def count_vowels(s):\n    vowels = 'aeiou'\n    count = 0\n    for ch in s.lower():\n        if ch in vowels:\n            count += 1\n    return count", "hints": "<list>", "examples": "<list>", "...": "17 more"}, "learning_chain": {"topic": "python_basics", "current_mastery": 1.0, "follow_up_difficulty": "intermediate", "next_step": "完成后尝试改写成更通用的函数，并挑战进阶变式题。"}, "...": "2 more"}}}
