{"event": "sub_agent_completed", "source": "EnhancedExerciseGenerationAgent", "target": "MainAgent", "request_id": "558e05f4-011e-4411-8512-cdd83b662af3", "user_id": "advanced_demo", "timestamp": "2026-05-08T21:37:25", "payload": {"success": true, "response": "已生成练习题:\n\n标题: 统计元音字母个数\n主题: python_basics | 难度: advanced\n描述: 编写一个函数 `count_vowels(s)`，接收一个字符串 `s`，统计其中元音字母（a, e, i, o, u）的个数（不区分大小写），并返回该整数结果。函数中必须使用 `return` 返回结果，不要仅用 `print` 输出。\n\n要求:\n- 完成题目要求\n\n示例:\n- 输入: count_vowels('Hello World')\n  输出: 3\n- 输入: count_vowels('PYTHON')\n  输出: 1\n- 输入: count_vowels('aeiou')\n  输出: 5\n- 输入: count_vowels('bcdfg')\n  输出: 0\n\n分级提示:\n1. 提示1：可以先将字符串转换为全小写或全大写，方便统一判断。\n2. 提示2：遍历字符串的每一个字符，判断它是否为元音字母。\n3. 提示3：使用 `if char in 'aeiou'` 来判断一个字符是否是元音。\n\n下一步: 完成后提交代码评测，系统会根据结果推荐下一题。\n来源: q...", "details": {"type": "exercise", "topic": "python_basics", "difficulty": "advanced", "personalized": true, "source": "question_bank", "question_count": 1, "exercise": {"id": 8, "topic": "python_basics", "content": "<dict>", "difficulty": "advanced", "question_type": "coding", "answer": "def count_vowels(s):\n    s = s.lower()\n    count = 0\n    for char in s:\n        if char in 'aeiou':\n            count += 1\n    return count", "hints": "<list>", "examples": "<list>", "...": "17 more"}, "learning_chain": {"topic": "python_basics", "current_mastery": 0.965, "follow_up_difficulty": "advanced", "next_step": "完成后提交代码评测，系统会根据结果推荐下一题。"}, "...": "2 more"}}}
