{"event": "sub_agent_completed", "source": "QAAgent", "target": "MainAgent", "request_id": "a019302c-d246-40af-ae14-0b3de98fe5cc", "user_id": "beginner_demo", "timestamp": "2026-05-10T14:35:38", "payload": {"success": true, "response": "我们换个视角：把函数看作一个**“处理盒”**，它的工作就是接收原料（参数），按固定流程加工，然后把成品交出来（返回值），或者默默完成任务。你不必重复写相同的加工步骤，需要时叫它就行。\n\n---\n\n### 1. 函数的基本结构（一个具体例子）\n假设我们经常要判断一个数字是不是偶数。直接写：\n```python\nnum = 4\nif num % 2 == 0:\n    print(\"偶数\")\n```\n每次遇到新数字都得重写 if 那两行。如果用函数：\n\n```python\ndef is_even(number):        # 1. 定义：def 函数名(参数名):\n    if number % 2 == 0:     # 2. 函数体：必须缩进\n        return True         # 3. 返回 True（交出去）\n    else:\n        return False\n```\n\n* `def is_even(number):` —— 告诉 Python：我们要做一个叫 `is_even` 的盒子，它需要一个叫 `number` 的原料。\n* 函数体缩进...", "details": {"source": "llm_thinking", "examples": [], "topic": "python_basics", "answer_type": "detailed", "personalized": true, "user_type": "beginner", "profile_summary": "user_type=beginner\nlevel=稳步提升\nstyle=concept_first\ngoals=?????? Python ????\nweak_topics=data_structures\nbehavior=submissions:9, first_pass:0.20, answer_views:4, hint_views:7\nconsecutive_failures={'python_basics': 2, 'data_structures': 3}\ntopic_metrics=python_basics(pass:0.33, first:0.33, fail:2); data_structures(pass:0.00, first:0.00, fail:3)\nerror_patterns=python_basics:连续失败 2 次, 频繁查看参考答案; data_structures:连续失败 3 次, 频繁查看参考答案", "profile_insights": {"profile_source": "personalized_learning_agent", "user_type": "beginner", "topic_mastery": 0.627278321921875, "needs_improvement": false, "recommended_difficulty": "beginner", "focus_areas": "<list>"}, "...": "3 more"}}}
